flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Begin NSGA2 MOO"]
InputVars["**Input Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities {1-10} integer"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize WIP and Maximize Throughput"]
Problem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines decision space and evaluation interface"]
Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Sampling crossover mutation generations"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Collection of capacity vectors"]
Evaluate["**Evaluate Population**<br/>Create parallel tasks for individuals"]
MP["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Execute evaluate tasks across n_cores"]
EvalSingle["**evaluate single individual**<br/>Run replications and aggregate KPIs"]
RunSimCaps["**run simulation with caps**<br/>Build simpy model with given buffer capacities"]
RunSim["**run simulation**<br/>SimPy execution during warmup and measure window"]
Machine["**Machine and DelayBuffer**<br/>Machine events availability failures and buffer tokens"]
SampleWIP["**WIP Sampling**<br/>Periodic measurement of ready in transit and in machines"]
ComputeObj["**Compute Objectives**<br/>Average WIP and Average Throughput per individual"]
Constraint["**Feasibility Check**<br/>Penalize individuals with zero production"]
Selection["**Selection and Archive**<br/>NSGA2 non dominated sorting and next generation"]
Termination["**Termination**<br/>Stop after configured number of generations"]
Export["**Export CSV**<br/>Write feasible solutions and KPIs from history"]
End["**End**<br/>Return Pareto front and CSV file"]

Start --> Problem
InputVars --> Problem
Objectives --> Problem
Problem --> Algorithm
Algorithm --> Population
Population --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> MP
MP --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> RunSim
RunSim --> Machine
RunSim --> SampleWIP
RunSim --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> ComputeObj
ComputeObj --> Constraint
Constraint --> Selection
Selection --> Population
Selection --> Termination
Termination --> Export
Export --> End